  "name": "Question 14",
  "problem": "Calculate $\\int \\frac{{cot}^{5}\u2061x-\\operatorname{cot}\u2061x}{(1-{cot}^{2}\u2061x)\\operatorname{csc}\u2061x}\\,\\text{d}x.$",
  "worked_solution": "In this case, we have to use the identity  $1+{cot}^{2}\u2061x={csc}^{2}\u2061x.$ \n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{{cot}^{5}\u2061x-\\operatorname{cot}\u2061x}{(1-{cot}^{2}\u2061x)\\operatorname{csc}\u2061x}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int \\frac{-\\operatorname{cot}\u2061x(1-{cot}^{4}\u2061x)}{(1-{cot}^{2}\u2061x)\\operatorname{csc}\u2061x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int \\frac{-\\operatorname{cot}\u2061x(1-{cot}^{2}\u2061x)(1+{cot}^{2}\u2061x)}{(1-{cot}^{2}\u2061x)\\operatorname{csc}\u2061x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int \\frac{-\\operatorname{cot}\u2061x{csc}^{2}\u2061x}{\\operatorname{csc}\u2061x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int -\\operatorname{cot}\u2061x\\operatorname{csc}\u2061x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\operatorname{csc}\u2061x+C\\end{aligned}\n$$",
